@startuml 08-observer-pattern
!include _style.iuml
title Observer, Factory and Adapter: events, audit and notifications

class IncidentService {
  + acknowledge(id, actor)
  + resolve(id, text, actor)
  ...
  - saveAndPublish(type, incident, actor, previous, text)
}
class IncidentEventPublisher <<subject>> {
  - observers : List<IncidentObserver>
  + publish(event : IncidentEvent)
}
interface IncidentObserver {
  + onEvent(event : IncidentEvent)
}
class AuditObserver <<@Order(1)>> {
  writes one audit_logs row
}
class NotificationObserver <<@Order(2)>> {
  + afterCommit()
  - dispatchSafely(request)
}
class IncidentEvent <<record>> {
  type : IncidentEventType
  incident : Incident
  actor : User
  previous : IncidentStatus
  current : IncidentStatus
  description : String
  at : Instant
  explicitRecipientIds : List<Long>
}
class NotificationRules {
  event → audiences + e-mail mode
}
class NotificationDispatcher {
  + dispatch(request)
}
class NotificationChannelFactory <<Factory>> {
  + get(type : ChannelType) : NotificationChannel
}
interface NotificationChannel {
  + type() : ChannelType
  + send(message : NotificationMessage)
}
class InAppChannel {
  saves a Notification row
}
class EmailChannel <<Adapter>> {
  - mailSender : JavaMailSender
}
class JavaMailSender <<Spring / SMTP>>
enum ChannelType {
  IN_APP
  EMAIL
}

IncidentService --> IncidentEventPublisher : publish
IncidentEventPublisher o--> "*" IncidentObserver
IncidentObserver <|.. AuditObserver
IncidentObserver <|.. NotificationObserver
IncidentEventPublisher ..> IncidentEvent
NotificationObserver --> NotificationRules : who should hear?
NotificationObserver --> NotificationDispatcher : after commit
NotificationDispatcher --> NotificationChannelFactory
NotificationChannelFactory ..> NotificationChannel : returns
NotificationChannel <|.. InAppChannel
NotificationChannel <|.. EmailChannel
EmailChannel --> JavaMailSender : adapts
NotificationChannel ..> ChannelType

note bottom of NotificationChannel
  A new mechanism (SMS, push, Slack) is one new class
  implementing NotificationChannel + one ChannelType value.
end note
@enduml
